      <Placemark>
        <name>Kasai Rinkai Park</name>
        <description><![CDATA[description: A great break from the dense parts of Tokyo. The park is huge and easy to reach, and the paths along the water are quiet and open. I came here with students after filming in the city, and it was one of the few places where we could actually stop, breathe, and reset before moving on. The ferris wheel gives a clear view of the bay, and the bird sanctuary is worth the walk if you want something calmer than the aquarium. Bring what you need before you enter because food options inside the park are limited.<br>説明: <br>nom: ]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1720-0F9D58</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="description">
            <value>A great break from the dense parts of Tokyo. The park is huge and easy to reach, and the paths along the water are quiet and open. I came here with students after filming in the city, and it was one of the few places where we could actually stop, breathe, and reset before moving on. The ferris wheel gives a clear view of the bay, and the bird sanctuary is worth the walk if you want something calmer than the aquarium. Bring what you need before you enter because food options inside the park are limited.</value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="説明">
            <value/>
          </Data>
          <Data name="nom">
            <value/>
          </Data>
        </ExtendedData>
        <Point>
