        <description><![CDATA[description: Kiso Fukushima Station (http://japanvisitor.blogspot.com/2013/09/kiso-fukushima-station.html) is on the Chuo Main Line from Nagoya to Shiojiri via Ena and Nakatsugawa. Eventually the Chuo Line continues on to Tokyo via Kofu and Mitaka.<br>説明: <br>nom: ]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1532-F9A825</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="description">
            <value>Kiso Fukushima Station (http://japanvisitor.blogspot.com/2013/09/kiso-fukushima-station.html) is on the Chuo Main Line from Nagoya to Shiojiri via Ena and Nakatsugawa. Eventually the Chuo Line continues on to Tokyo via Kofu and Mitaka.</value>
