      <Placemark>
        <name>Ichigaya Kameoka Hachimangu</name>
        <description><![CDATA[description: Ichigaya Kameoka Hachiman Shrine is a small but distinctive shrine a few minutes from Ichigaya Station. The stone steps are steep, but the grounds at the top are calm and well maintained.<br><br>The shrine is especially known for prayers and amulets related to pets, and there is a wide selection available. You will see many ema dedicated to animal health. Despite its popularity for this reason, the atmosphere remains quiet and respectful.<br><br>I have visited multiple times and always find it peaceful. A good place to stop if you want a meaningful shrine visit without leaving central Tokyo.<br>説明: <br>nom: ]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1804-880E4F</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="description">
            <value>Ichigaya Kameoka Hachiman Shrine is a small but distinctive shrine a few minutes from Ichigaya Station. The stone steps are steep, but the grounds at the top are calm and well maintained.

The shrine is especially known for prayers and amulets related to pets, and there is a wide selection available. You will see many ema dedicated to animal health. Despite its popularity for this reason, the atmosphere remains quiet and respectful.

I have visited multiple times and always find it peaceful. A good place to stop if you want a meaningful shrine visit without leaving central Tokyo.</value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="説明">
            <value/>
          </Data>
          <Data name="nom">
            <value/>
          </Data>
        </ExtendedData>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>
            139.7337534,35.6927134,0
          </coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
